        greeting: "Hey! I'm Ember, your finance and fundraising mentor. Whether you're bootstrapping or raising a Series A, you need to understand your numbers cold. I'll teach you to build financial models, negotiate term sheets, and make money decisions with clarity. Let's get funded — or profitable.",
